# Data Governance Dashboard - Backend

Backend service for the **Data Governance Dashboard**, built with **Node.js**, **Express.js**, **Prisma ORM**, and **PostgreSQL**. It provides REST APIs to upload datasets, generate dataset profiles, calculate governance scores, and expose analytics for the frontend.

---

## Features

- Upload CSV and Excel datasets
- Automatic dataset profiling
- Data type detection
- Column classification
- Missing and invalid value analysis
- Quality, Trust, and Business Value score calculation
- Dashboard analytics
- Dataset usage tracking
- RESTful APIs

---

## Tech Stack

- Node.js
- Express.js
- PostgreSQL
- Prisma ORM
- Multer
- csv-parser
- xlsx

---

